# LaTeX build intermediates. Everything here is regenerated by pdflatex and is
# derived entirely from the .tex -- tracking them made every report commit carry
# a thousand-line .log diff. The built .pdf IS tracked on purpose: the README
# ships it for readers without a TeX install.
#
# Deliberately scoped to report/ and NOT written as bare *.out / *.log:
#   - FESOM mesh files are nod2d.out, elem2d.out, aux3d.out, cavity_nlvls.out,
#     nlvls.out, map_nod.out -- a bare *.out would silently swallow any of those.
#   - data/movcav6_voskin_snapshot/ carries a tracked compute .log (crash evidence).
/report/*.aux
/report/*.log
/report/*.out
/report/*.toc
/report/*.fls
/report/*.fdb_latexmk
/report/*.synctex.gz
/report/*.bbl
/report/*.blg

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
